 "description": "WP-O6 Codex: Orks (11e) WARPATH (Weirdboy psychic) through the real unit_selected_to_fight window. Fixture ork11e_ab_fight: the Weirdboy is engaged with Witchseekers C. After the pile-in step, a real click on 'Fight' for the Weirdboy opens the window; 'Use on Weirdboy' makes the psychic roll: its melee attacks re-roll wound rolls of 1 and have [PSYCHIC] (live hook); it fights. The Kill Rig's Warpath ([LETHAL HITS]) is pinned headless. Setup privileges: auto wound allocation, the Custodes' wounds inflated (the fight must not end the scenario). The Custodes player's IN AURAMITE CLAD card (WP-C5, offered when the Weirdboy targets Witchseekers C — ANATHEMA PSYKANA units carry the ADEPTUS CUSTODES faction keyword) is declined with a real click (WP-FIX1).",
